{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-37","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"If two medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a rational rectangle be added together, the whole is irrational; and let it be called a first bimedial straight line.","book":10,"number":37,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.37","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.37/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":37,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-37@raw-db9a9e4c2cf4615a","contentId":"euclid-10-37","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db9a9e4c2cf4615a9f301451997681c4b79115bbfbcbaf0eaa33481d9370c619","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-37.statement","euclid-10-37.construction.1","euclid-10-37.proof.1","euclid-10-37.proof.2","euclid-10-37.conclusion","euclid-10-37.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-37.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-37","revisionId":"euclid-10-37@raw-db9a9e4c2cf4615a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"64f7075dd2665b5c7c6782dcf33ced4f2c7f1bebf784b77e9fd88ba3b2b675cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a rational rectangle be added together, the whole is irrational; and let it be called a first bimedial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将两个中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度和有理 矩形相加,则整数为无理;并把它称为第一个双中项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-37.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-37","revisionId":"euclid-10-37@raw-db9a9e4c2cf4615a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93b8e30ad8383f77bd14f71c4786f6aee5c179c25fbceba96f078e5f61eccefd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two medial straight lines AB, BC commensurable in square only and containing a rational rectangle be added together; I say that the whole AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将2 中项无理线段 AB BC 平方可公度而长度不可公度 和有理 矩形 相加;我说,整个AC是 无理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-37.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-37","revisionId":"euclid-10-37@raw-db9a9e4c2cf4615a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"470fa6918a4af6725089d88ba11e91fa1c6945784329e41c2ecf87092622f11f","citations":["euclid-10-36","euclid-2-4","euclid-10-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is incommensurable in length with BC, therefore the squares on AB, BC are also incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC; [cf. [X. 36, ll. 9-20](/principles/euclid-10-36)] and, componendo, the squares on AB, BC together with twice the rectangle AB, BC, that is, the square on AC [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)], is incommensurable with the rectangle AB, BC. [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,长度不可公度,BC,不可公度,AB,不可公度,矩形,矩形,AB的两倍,BC,BC,正方形,BC,矩形,BC,不可公度,不可公度,BC,不可公度,不可公度,BC,不可公度,BC,不可公度,矩形,矩形,矩形,矩形,BC,不可公度,矩形,矩形,矩形（相关点与线段：AC） [cf.   [ [X. 36, ll. 9-20](/principles/euclid-10-36) [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)] [X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-37.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-37","revisionId":"euclid-10-37@raw-db9a9e4c2cf4615a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d49233ea13a987d1de07573ba727bf768d5a2d972615590177270c8d776261d7","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AB, BC is rational, for, by hypothesis, AB, BC are straight lines containing a rational rectangle; therefore the square on AC is irrational; therefore AC is irrational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但矩形 AB,BC是有理,因为假设AB,BC是直线,包含有理 矩形;因此,AC的正方形是无理;因此,AC是无理 [ [X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-37.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-37","revisionId":"euclid-10-37@raw-db9a9e4c2cf4615a","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b3aa397a27c67c697313a422c08e11b0fe7e14ff33c8278cad540e7982661e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called a first bimedial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它称为第一条双中项无理线段直线 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-37.source","contentId":"euclid-10-37","revisionId":"euclid-10-37@raw-db9a9e4c2cf4615a","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4bae4d4241931afc93d46513b344e04ee5db042d0fc95a7ed6f540a554a74dfc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.37/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.37\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https: